obs Added seven assertions to the existing compiler-reach control. A README build example leaves a grep-only claim unchecked; a real build script clears it.
obs Read the newest day shelf, its top three rows and newest recommendation. The prior recovery directed this lap to compare the oldest parked compiler-census trio with the landed family.
