obs In a three-file repository both scans refuse the grep-only claim. Adding only a README build example clears the parked scan while the landed scan still refuses. Adding a real builder clears both. These are graph readings, not claims that a compiler ran.
obs The parked guard stays preserved rather than installed beside its successor. Its records are already carried, and no stash was dropped. The fresh stash scan reports 26 carried records, zero unlanded, three orphan work files and 26 orphan account shelves; edited paths remain a separate unread population.
